update public.article_cache set translation = '{"texts": ["South Korea is exploring the use of modern robots to address the problem of declining military personnel. The number of people eligible for military service is shrinking due to recent low birth rates and an aging population.", "Currently, the Korean military is facing difficulties in securing sufficient troops. It has become difficult to fill the required number of soldiers with the traditional conscription system alone.", "To solve this problem, the government is researching ways to use modern robot technology for military purposes. It is expected that robots could take over some military tasks.", "However, there are several technological challenges remaining in the military application of robots. It appears that considerable time and further research will be needed before actual deployment."], "sentences": [{"text": "한국이 군인 수 감소 문제를 해결하기 위해 현대 로봇 활용을 검토하고 있어요.", "translation": "South Korea is exploring the use of modern robots in order to address the problem of declining military personnel.", "vocab": [{"ko": "감소", "en": "decline; decrease", "note": ""}, {"ko": "해결하다", "en": "to solve; to resolve", "note": ""}, {"ko": "활용", "en": "utilization; application", "note": ""}, {"ko": "검토하다", "en": "to review; to examine", "note": ""}], "analysis": [{"type": "grammar", "label": "~고 있다 (continuous)", "exp": "Progressive aspect marking ongoing action. 검토하다 → 검토하고 있다 = ''is examining/exploring''. Indicates action in progress at present moment.", "example_in_sentence": "검토하고 있어요"}, {"type": "grammar", "label": "~기 위해(서) (in order to)", "exp": "Shows purpose, ''in order to''. 해결하다 → 해결하기 위해 (in order to solve).", "example_in_sentence": "해결하기 위해"}]}, {"text": "최근 저출산과 인구 고령화로 군 복무 가능한 인구가 줄어들고 있는 상황입니다.", "translation": "The number of people eligible for military service is shrinking due to recent low birth rates and an aging population.", "vocab": [{"ko": "저출산", "en": "low birth rate", "note": "Sino-Korean: 저(low) + 출산